          "jcr:created": "Tue Aug 14 2018 13:18:08 GMT-0400",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "line1": "<span class=\"fontsize-3vw\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5-vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 181, 0);\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Jump start your cleaning with</span></span></span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 181, 0);\"> Blu62</span></span></span></span>",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 14 2018 13:31:46 GMT-0400",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/largeheadline",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(255,255,255,1)",
          "textIsRich": [
            "true",
            "true"
          ]
        },
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Surfactants begin cleaning and prevent drying at the point of care</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Enables visual verification of coverage by foam and color</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Makes cleaning more efficient</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Helps fulfill recommended pretreatment practices of AAMI and AORN<sup>2-3</sup></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 02 2018 18:18:55 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(255,255,255,1)",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
    "cols3": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Fri Jun 15 2018 14:34:12 GMT-0400",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jun 15 2018 14:34:12 GMT-0400",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/columncontrol/cols3",
      "col1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5b105250fc@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jun 29 2018 14:29:29 GMT-0400",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Rinsability</span></span></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Optimizes cleaning results by preventing redistribution and adhesion of chemical residuals and biofilm particulate in wash sink water</li>\n<li>Rinses spot and residue free under running water; no need for scrubbing, wiping or mechanical&nbsp;action/agitation</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 14 2018 13:25:31 GMT-0400",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jun 29 2018 16:31:16 GMT-0400",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 181, 0);\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Cleanability</span></span></span></h3>\n<p>Removes build up, even build up from past detergents used</p>\n<p>Revitalizes instruments by removing stubborn soil, biofilm, protein soil and total organic carbon (TOC)</p>\n<p>Deodorizes unpleasant soils via lavender-mint fragrance</p>\n<p>Effectively cleans complex instruments such as those with crevasses, irregular surface textures and multiple moving parts</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 02 2018 18:19:14 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "text_1061112785": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jun 29 2018 16:51:03 GMT-0400",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 181, 0);\">Efficiencies</span></span></span></h3>\n<p>Enhances longevity and quality of reprocessed devices; optimizing your investment</p>\n<p>Demonstrated to reduce repairs for corrosion of electrical and mechanical components, rough/sticky assemblies and damaged or seized motor bearings</p>\n<p>Effective on Stryker and non-Stryker medical instruments</p>\n<p>pH neutral for compatibility with a range of metals, plastics and composite materials</p>\n<p>Compatibled with Stryker's Instrument Detergent System (IDS) for automated, precision dosing into sink, basin or sonic washer</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 02 2018 18:19:33 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
