    "disclaimer": "<p>1. ProClean white paper. &quot;ProClean adds value to any powered equipment account.&quot; Stryker Instruments, 2012.</p>\r\n<p>2. Association for the Advancement of Medical Instrumentation (AAMI). &quot;Comprehensive guide to steam sterilization\r\nand sterility assurance in health care facilities.&quot; ST 79, section 6/4. 2010\r\n</p>\r\n<p>3. Association of Perioperative Nurses (AORN). &quot;Guidelines for sterilization and disinfection.&quot; Section III.G. 2017. </p>\r\n",
